            "text": "<p>Whales play a vital role in maintaining healthy ocean ecosystems. As one of the largest animals on Earth, they help support marine biodiversity and contribute to the balance of ocean life.</p><p>Protecting whales helps protect our oceans, and healthy oceans are essential for the future of our planet.</p>",
